      <VERS vnumber="2">Then was <gr str="2734">kindled </gr>the <gr str="639">wrath </gr>of <gr str="453">Elihu </gr>the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="1292">Barachel </gr>the <gr str="940">Buzite</gr>, of the <gr str="4940">kindred </gr>of <gr str="7410">Ram</gr>: against <gr str="347">Job </gr>was his <gr str="639">wrath </gr>
