        <gr str="347">Job</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="4">Now <gr str="453">Elihu </gr>had <gr str="2442">waited </gr>till <gr str="347">Job </gr>had <gr str="1697">spoken</gr>, because they <STYLE css="font-style:italic">were </STYLE>
