        <gr str="7969">three </gr>
        <gr str="582">men</gr>, then his <gr str="639">wrath </gr>was <gr str="2734">kindled</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">And <gr str="453">Elihu </gr>the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="1292">Barachel </gr>the <gr str="940">Buzite </gr>
        <gr str="6030">answered </gr>and <gr str="559">said</gr>, I <STYLE css="font-style:italic">am </STYLE>
        <gr str="6810 3117">young</gr>, and ye <STYLE css="font-style:italic">are</STYLE> very <gr str="3453">old</gr>; therefore I was <gr str="2119">afraid</gr>, and <gr str="3372">dared </gr>not <gr str="2331">show </gr>you my <gr str="1843">opinion</gr>. <DIV>
