          <NOTE type="x-studynote">left…: Heb. removed speeches from themselves</NOTE>
        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="16">When I had <gr str="3176">waited</gr>, (for they <gr str="1696">spoke </gr>not, but stood <gr str="5975">still</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">and </STYLE>
        <gr str="6030">answered </gr>no more;)</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="17">
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">I said</STYLE>, I will <gr str="6030">answer </gr>also my <gr str="2506">part</gr>, I also will <gr str="2331">show </gr>my <gr str="1843">opinion</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="18">For I am <gr str="4390">full </gr>of <gr str="4405">matter</gr>, the <gr str="7307">spirit </gr>
        <gr str="990">within </gr>me <gr str="6693">constraineth </gr>me. <DIV>
