      <VERS vnumber="20">I will <gr str="1696">speak</gr>, that I may be <gr str="7304">refreshed</gr>: I will <gr str="6605">open </gr>my <gr str="8193">lips </gr>and <gr str="6030">answer</gr>. <DIV>
