      <VERS vnumber="22">For I <gr str="3045">know </gr>not to give flattering <gr str="3655">titles</gr>; <STYLE css="font-style:italic">in so doing</STYLE> my <gr str="6213">maker </gr>would <gr str="4592">soon </gr>take me <gr str="5375">away</gr>.</VERS>
